	<item>
		<title>Introducing our new Pravda network dataset: 15 million articles in 47 languages</title>
		<link>https://checkfirst.network/introducing-our-new-pravda-network-dataset-15-million-articles-in-47-languages/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:30:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://checkfirst.network/?p=3764</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Our dataset on this pro-Kremlin Information Manipulation Set (IMS) has more than doubled: from over 7 million to more than 15 million articles, published across 88 websites in 47 languages. Here is what changed, what we share openly with the community, and what we make available to analysts who need to go further.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://checkfirst.network/introducing-our-new-pravda-network-dataset-15-million-articles-in-47-languages/">Introducing our new Pravda network dataset: 15 million articles in 47 languages</a> appeared first on <a href="https://checkfirst.network">CheckFirst</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
